# Aethon Agency OS — Cursor Rules

You are working on Aethon, an open-source AI agency operating system.
Before ANY change: read CLAUDE.md for architecture rules.

## Backend (FastAPI + SQLAlchemy async)
- All route handlers must include: get_current_user, get_org_context
- All DB queries: filter by ctx.org.id (org_id scoping — non-negotiable)
- New models: org_id FK, created_at, updated_at columns required
- Async only: use await everywhere, no sync DB calls
- Return 404 not 403 when a cross-org resource is requested
- Pydantic v2 syntax: model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True)

## Frontend (React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind)
- New pages: MUST have isLoading (skeleton), isError, empty state
- Cards: use glass-card class (see tailwind.config.js — NOT bg-obsidian-900)
- Primary buttons: btn-primary (NOT bg-blue-600 manually)
- Forms: label + input with .input class
- Errors: use extractApiError() from ../api/client
- Mutations: always show loading state + success/error toast

## Design system
- Primary color: #2563EB (blue, NOT purple/indigo)
- Card background: glass-card (backdrop-blur)
- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans (headings), Inter (body)
- See tailwind.config.js for full token reference

## Tests
- Backend: pytest with asyncio, add to backend/tests/
- Frontend: Playwright E2E, add to frontend/e2e/
- New features: at minimum one backend test + one Playwright test

## Critical: DO NOT MODIFY
- backend/runtime/agent_runner.py
- backend/runtime/workflow_engine.py
- backend/runtime/graph_builder.py
- backend/services/permission_engine.py
- (see CLAUDE.md for full list)
